<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S4.T3.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance results for FSS on FSS-<math id="S4.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1000</annotation></semantics></math> dataset and domain-shift from COCO-<math id="S4.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="20^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>20</mn><mi>i</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">20^{i}</annotation></semantics></math> to PASCAL-VOC dataset with mIoU metric.
The best results are highlighted in <span id="S4.T3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> and the second-best results are <span id="S4.T3.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.
